// megler-w10m: the original's SupportLibReflectionUtil is not compiled (tools/build-framework.sh, "A third kind").
// The original put a class of this name into the framework so that androidx.webkit, which looks for it through
// WebView.getWebViewClassLoader(), found the original's glue (android.webkit.MeglerSupportLib). Here the WebView is
// Chromium's and its APK carries the real class of this name, Chromium's support-library glue. There is one class path
// in this runtime, where the framework's classes come first: a framework class of this name would hide the WebView's
// (docs/JAVA.md, "The WebView").
